  unitName: Retribution Demon Mirfah
  unitId: 60786
  unitNumber: 1121
  description: 'A mock Unit modeled after Mirfah, survivor of Ishgria''s Recon Squad.
    The land of Ishgria, with its countless demons, proved too harsh for a human
    to survive alone. Subsequently, this apparently led him to sacrifice much in
    order to gain the power required for survival. However, there was one thing that
    he never let go of: the Recon Squad''s records. To this day, Mirfah has yet to
    tell the full story contained within them.'
  summonDesc: Rhoa, your research<br>has borne fruit over the ages.<br>Someday, I'll
    give you a full report.
  fusionDesc: I don't care how I get stronger.<br>I must live on...<br>For the members
    of the Recon Squad.
  evoDesc: I was changed by an alien power,<br>and now I'll evolve to a new form.<br>Am
    I still a man? Or am I a demon?
  element: 6
  rarity: 6
